    "notes": "Removed the 'Base of east face' pin (typed Junction): 3DEP reads 7,037 ft there vs the 6,600 ft it claims, ~112 m from the summit; a 1,200 ft face cannot start ~700 ft below the top. No mapped base feature to re-place it. Summit pin elev/elevFt was the string \"7720\"; now the number 7720. Hairpin-pullout trailhead pin: no OSM parking node; 3DEP 5,151 ft vs pin 5,200 ft - unlocked. FA month (July) is MP-only; AAJ gives the year. The bivy entry says parties sleep at the Blue Lake lot; The Mountaineers SEWS page says camping is NOT permitted at that trailhead (USFS page only bans camping within 0.25 mi of the lake) - check. theCrag lists this as 5.13a / 500 m (the free line) - not used. SummitPost answered 403 in Chrome."
